{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53010","headline":"句 · 严维","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"观身岸额离根草，论命江头不系舟。\n（见《日本古典文学大系》七三册藤原公任《和汉朗咏集》卷下《无常》）（〖1〗川口久雄校注《和汉朗咏集》云：「底本注作者爲『罗维』，柿村氏以爲『罗维当系严维之误』。\n」其说是。\n《全唐诗》卷七七○收罗维《水精环》，即爲严维之误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53010.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53010","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}